|-
! {{zh-l|*我儂}} !! we
| ''ua neiŋ'' || ''gua laŋ'' || ''gun'' ({{zh-l|*阮}}) || ''kuoŋ ~ kŋ'' ({{zh-l|*滾}})
|-
! {{zh-l|*儂儂}} !! we (''inclusive'')
| - || ''laŋ laŋ'' || ''lan'' ({{zh-l|*咱}}) || -
|-
