====Usage notes====
* As a formal noun ({{m|ja|形式名詞|tr=keishiki meishi}}), this term is almost exclusively written in hiragana as {{m|ja|まま}}.
* Used in phrases with the literary particle {{m|ja|が}}:&mdash;
*: {{ja-usex-inline|[[思う]]が'''まま'''に[[生きる]]|おも.う が '''まま''' に いきる|to live freely (in accordance with whatever one thinks)}}
*: {{ja-usex-inline|[[我がまま|我が'''まま''']]|わが'''まま'''|(doing) as one wants to &mdash; selfish}}
*: {{ja-usex-inline|[[言う|言われる]]が'''まま'''|いわれる が '''まま'''|(doing) as one is told}}
* For sense 3, {{m|ja|…とも[[儘]]よ|tr=…to mo mama yo}} or {{m|ja|…と[[儘]]よ|tr=…to mama yo}} was mostly used in the past.

