===Etymology 1===
{{zh-forms|s=儿|alt=児,𠒇,𫤘}}
From {{inh|zh|sit-pro|*m/s-ŋa-j||small; inferior; offspring}} (STEDT). Cognate with {{cog|my|ငယ်||little; young}}, {{cog|kac|shangai|tr=ʃă³¹ ŋai³¹|t=to give birth}}.

According to {{zh-ref|Schuessler (2007)}}, it may be an area word; compare {{cog|mkh-pro|*ŋa(i)k||baby}}, {{cog|mkh-ban-pro|*ŋaː||baby}}, {{cog|km|ង៉ា||infant; baby}}. The word is also cognate with {{och-l|倪|small and weak}}. {{zh-l|*伢}} is the southern dialectal form of {{ltc-l|兒|child; son|id=1}}.

